
# Playwright CLI session debris
.playwright-cli/

# Narrator run output, wherever a PDF is dropped. These folders hold the
# recovered form data and the finished narrative for a real case, so nothing
# matching this pattern may ever be staged.
*-narrative/

# Simon's working bill-narrative template and hand-formatted samples. They
# carry real fee-earner names and residue from real cases — see
# ~/coding/LLM-benchmarking/docs/real-format-notes.md §B7, which records the
# sanitised anatomy precisely so the file itself never needs committing.
CCMS_BN*.docx
enhancementText.docx
_FORMAT-OPTIONS.docx
.drive-output/

# The Collator's own downloads, in every name it has ever used. A real one
# copied into the repo to diagnose is a privileged client document, and this
# repo is public — `git add .` must never be able to stage it. The committed
# test fixtures live under _narrator/tests/fixtures/ and are re-included
# explicitly below.
Uplift_Justification*.docx
Uplift_Justification*.pdf
LAA_Uplift_Data_Summary*.pdf
!_narrator/tests/fixtures/*.docx
!_narrator/tests/fixtures/*.pdf
